e, size))\n42\t}\n43\t\n44\tpub(super) unsafe fn vpmm_create_physical(\n45\t    device_ordinal: i32,\n46\t    bytes: usize,\n47\t) -> Result<CUmemGenericAllocationHandle, CudaError> {\n48\t    let mut h: CUmemGenericAllocationHandle = 0;\n49\t    CudaError::from_result(_vpmm_create_physical(device_ordinal, bytes, &mut h))?;\n50\t    Ok(h)\n51\t}\n52\t\n53\tpub(super) unsafe fn vpmm_map(\n54\t    va: CUdeviceptr,\n55\t    bytes: usize,\n56\t    h: CUmemGenericAllocationHandle,\n57\t) -> Result<(), CudaError> {\n58\t    CudaError::from_result(_vpmm_map(va, bytes, h))\n59\t}\n60\t\n61\tpub(super) unsafe fn vpmm_set_access(\n62\t    va: CUdeviceptr,\n63\t    bytes: usize,\n64\t    device_ordinal: i32,\n65\t) -> Result<(), CudaError> {\n66\t    CudaError::from_result(_vpmm_set_access(va, bytes, device_ordinal))\n67\t}\n68\t\n69\tpub(super) unsafe fn vpmm_unmap(va: CUdeviceptr, bytes: usize) -> Result<(), CudaError> {\n70\t    CudaError::from_result(_vpmm_unmap(va, bytes))\n71\t}\n72\t\n73\tpub(super) unsafe fn vpmm_release(h: CUmemGenericAllocationHandle) -> Result<(), CudaError> {\n74\t    CudaError::from_result(_vpmm_release(h))\n75\t}\n76\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01CxAp3cyzXvfpYeFo9ZYegw","session_id":"d346b169-4c5b-4579-98c0-3e4f65b0717e","uuid":"32256b45-63ef-4c64-97f2-2ac288fe17c5","timestamp":"2026-04-11T07:03:00.349Z"}
