ons` via unsafe block (line 91)\n- Per-AIR GPU kernel launch (not batched)\n\n**Logup Combinations (lines 677-695)**\n- Similar pattern: `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle_monomial.rs` (lines 509-580)\n- GPU kernels: `precompute_logup_numer_combinations` and `precompute_logup_denom_combinations`\n- Also per-AIR launches\n\n**EQ Evaluation Layers (lines 699-707)**\n```rust\nfor &n in &self.n_per_trace {\n    let n_lift = n.max(0) as usize;\n    if let Entry::Vacant(entry) = self.eq_xis.entry(n_lift) {\n        let layers = EqEvalLayers::new_rev(n_lift, xi[l_skip..l_skip + n_lift].iter().rev())?;\n        entry.insert(layers);\n    }\n}\n```\n- Cached by `n_lift` (reused across AIRs with same height)\n- **Performance note at line 697-698:** \"could also build the layers for different n in a transposed way using eq_nonoverlapping_stage_ext, which is more memory efficient\"\n\n**Selector Base Creation (lines 709-722)**\n```rust\nself.sels_per_trace_base = self.n_per_trace.iter().map(|&n| {\n    let height = 1 << n_lift;\n    let mut cols = F::zero_vec(3 * height);\n    // Create is_first, is_transition, is_last columns\n    let d_cols = cols.to_device()?;\n    Ok(DeviceMatrix::new(Arc::new(d_cols), height, 3))\n}).collect()?;\n```\n- Per-trace H2D transfer\n\n---\n\n### **4. PHASE 1 Sub-phase B: Batched Kernel Launches (lines 1033-1155)**\n\n#### **Zerocheck Batching (lines 1068-1105)**\n```rust\nif !zc_batch_metas.is_empty() {\n    let zc_total_x_blocks: u32 = zc_batch_x_blocks.iter().sum();\n    let (zc_seg_offsets, zc_air_for_block) = build_batch_arrays(&zc_batch_x_blocks);\n    \n    // Transfer metadata and indexing arrays to GPU\n    let d_zc_metas_bytes: DeviceBuffer<u8> = unsafe { /* ... */ };\n    let d_zc_air_for_block = zc_air_for_block.to_device()?;\n    let d_zc_seg_offsets = zc_seg_offsets.to_device()?;\n    \n    // Single batched kernel launch\n    crate::cuda::logup_zerocheck::zerocheck_ntt_eval_constraints_batc